How to rotate credentials
-------------------------
- Anthropic key: edit /etc/ops-phoenix/secret (preserve 0600 perms)
- GitHub PAT: re-issue at https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens
 then overwrite /etc/ops-phoenix/gh-token
- Grafana token: re-issue in Grafana → API keys, then overwrite the file

After any rotation, trigger one manual run to verify.